  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tito</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1-2" />Paulo, Mawu sɔmɔlɔ kɛ Yesu Kristo tsɔlɔ ɔ nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ. A tsɔ mi nɛ ma ya wo ni nɛmɛ nɛ Mawu hla mɛ ɔ a hemi kɛ yemi he wami, konɛ ma tsɔɔ mɛ nɛ a le Mawu anɔkuale nɛ haa nɔ tsakeɔ e tsui. Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ a na neneene wami nɛ Mawu, nɔ nɛ yi lakpa a wo mɛ he si loko a bɔ je ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Nɛ ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e be nɛ sa mi ɔ, e je Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ kpo paa kɛ tsɔɔ nɛ e ha mi he blɔ kaa ma fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ. Mawu, wa yi wami helɔ ɔ fami nya a, a to kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi nɛ ɔ kɛ wo ye dɛ nɛ ma tsu kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />I ngma kɛ ya ha Tito nɛ ji ye bi anɔkuale mi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ mi ɔ ke: Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Tsɛ Mawu ɔ kɛ Kristo Yesu, wa yi wami helɔ ɔ dɛ mi ɔ ha mo.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo nya dali a hlami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />I si mo ngɛ Kreta wo kpɔ ɔ nɔ konɛ o pee nɔ́ nɛ he hia kɛ wo asafo ɔmɛ he wami. Nɛ o hla nikɔtɔmahi ngɛ ma fɛɛ ma nɛ yeɔ ye kitahi nɛ i wo mo ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Bumi nɛ hi ni nɛmɛ nɛ o maa hla amɛ a he. A pee yo kaketsɛmɛ nɛ a bimɛ suɔ Nutsɔ ɔ, nɛ a tui a he munyu yaya ko kaa a ji nihi nɛ a hɛ mi jɔɛ aloo nihi nɛ bui a fɔli. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Piami ko nɛ ko hi nikɔtɔma nɛ ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa Mawu sɔmɔli ji mɛ. A ko pee nihi nɛ woɔ a he nɔ aloo nihi nɛ na we tsui; nɛ a ko pee da deli loo pɛli aloo nihi nɛ hɛ tsuɔ woɔ sika he. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />A pee nihi nɛ peeɔ nɔ nubwɔ nɛ a suɔ nɔ́ nɛ hi. A hine juɛmitsɛmɛ nɛ yeɔ dami sane, nihi nɛ a he tsɔ nɛ a juɛmi ka si. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />A hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ mi ɔ nɛ pi si, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nyɛ nɛ a tsɔɔ ni kpahi kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ jee munyu ɔ he nguane ɔ he nɛ a tɔmi ngɛ.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Ejakaa nihi babauu ngɛ nɛ a tsɔɔ atuã, titli ɔ, nihi nɛ deɔ ke Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa nɛ ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ. Se enɛ ɔ ji munyu nɛ dɛ, nɛ ha we nɛ a na anɔkuale ɔ, <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />nɛ e sa kaa a kpa. Ejakaa kikɛmɛ a tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, nyɛ sika kɛkɛ nɛ a ngɛ hlae, nɛ a ha nɛ wehi fuu kpale ngɛ Mawu dloomi ɔ se. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ ji gbalɔ nɛ je Kreta a ye a he odase ke, “Kreta bi nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo yeɔ lakpa, a ngɛ kaa lohwe hejɔ peeli nɛ a muklii mi se pɛ a dii.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Anɔkuale munyu ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mo kã Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi wawɛɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi nɛ wa. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Nɛ a ko bu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nyazia amɛ tue, nɛ a ko pee níhi nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ kpale ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ se ɔ ngɛ hlae nɛ a pee ɔ.<verse eid="TIT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Nɔmlɔ nɛ e tsui mi tsɔ ɔ, e naa nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ kaa e hi nɛ e he tsɔ. Se nɔ nɛ tsui mi tsɔ we kɛ nɔ nɛ he we yi ɔ, e naa yayami ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi, ejakaa e juɛmi yaya a kɛ atuã tsɔmi tsui ɔ futuu nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e naa kɛ nɔ nɛ e nuɔ ɔ.<verse eid="TIT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ deɔ ke a le Mawu, se a ni peemi tsɔɔ kaa a li Mawu. A ji nihi nɛ puɛ, tue gboli nɛ he be se nami ngɛ ni tsumi kpakpa ko kulaa mi.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ga womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Se moo lɛɛ moo tsɔɔ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ anɔkuale si himi kpakpa a. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Moo slɔ nyumu nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a hɛ nɛ ka si nɛ a le nɛ a he anɔkuale ɔ nɛ a ye, nɛ a pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ kɛ suɔmi kɛ tsui si tomi.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Moo slɔ yi nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a pee kpoo, nɛ a bu nɔ ngɛ a nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peemi mi. A ko tu nihi a he munyu yaya, nɛ a ko pee da deli; se mohu a tsɔɔ nɔ́ nɛ hi. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Nɛ mɛ hu a tsɔse yihewi ɔmɛ nɛ a ba a je mi ngɛ kpoo peemi mi nɛ a suɔ a hunohi kɛ a bimɛ, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />nɛ a le nɔ, nɛ a juɛmi mi nɛ tsɔ, nɛ a hi si ngɛ a wehi a mi. A mi mi nɛ jɔ nɛ a ba a he si kɛ ha a hunohi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nihi nɛ le mɛ ɔ a ko tu Kristo se nyɛɛli a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he munyu yaya.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Moo tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ nihewi ɔmɛ hu ja a nɔuu, nɛ a ba a je mi saminya nɛ a hɛ nɛ ka si. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Nɛ mo nitsɛ hu o ngɔ o he kɛ pee nɔ hyɛmi nɔ́ kɛ ha mɛ ngɛ ni tsumi kpakpa fɛɛ ni tsumi kpakpa mi, nɛ a na o anɔkuale ɔ ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi kaa o fiɛ we. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />O ni sɛɛmi he nɛ tsɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko na nɔ́ yaya ko ngɛ he nɛ a de, konɛ zo nɛ gbe nɔ ko nɛ ma hla kaa e kɛ mo nɛ sa nya a. Ejakaa e be nɔ́ yaya ko nae.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Moo tsɔɔ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ nɛ a bu a nutsɔ ɔmɛ tue, nɛ a sa a hɛ mi. A ko je munyu nya, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />nɛ a ko ju, se mohu a na mɛ kaa anɔkuale yeli. Kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e ma ha nɛ nihi ma he wa Yiwamihelɔ kɛ Mawu ɔ nɔ maa ye.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Ejakaa Mawu dloomi nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ ji neneene yi wami hemi ɔ, a kɛ ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ hae. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Nɛ nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ ɔ tsɔɔ wɔ kaa Mawu ngɛ hlae nɛ wa kua nɔ́ yayami peemi kɛ je nɛ ɔ mi akɔnɔ níhi. Waa ba wa je mi kpakpa, nɛ waa ye Mawu gbeye ngɛ wa si himi mi daa kɛ daa. <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Waa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ be nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ nɔ, benɛ wa maa na e anunyami ɔ, nɛ ji wa Mawu Ope ɔ kɛ wa Yiwamihelɔ Yesu Kristo anunyami ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />E gbo ngɛ wa nane mi ngɛ wa he yayami ɔmɛ a he konɛ e kɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ je yayami kulaa mi nɛ e tsukɔ wa he nɛ e ngɔ wɔ kɛ pee lɛ nitsɛ e níhi nɛ wa na tsui klɔuu kɛ nɔ́ kpakpa peemi he bua jɔmi. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Moo tsɔɔ mɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ o wo mɛ he wami nɛ a ye nɔ, nɛ o tsɛ a tue se ngɛ a tɔmihi a he kaa nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e peeɔ ja. Ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e susu kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ o de ɔ, e he be se nami.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kaimi kɛ slɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Mo kai o ni ɔmɛ nɛ a ba a he si kɛ ha amlaalo ɔ kɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a bu mɛ be fɛɛ be, nɛ a dla a he kɛ ha ni tsumi kpakpa be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />A ko tu nɔ ko he munyu yaya, nɛ a ko pɛ, se mohu a ba a he si nɛ a bu nɔ tsuaa nɔ.<verse eid="TIT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Be nɛ be ɔ mi ɔ, wɔ hu wa li nɔ́ ko, nɛ wa bui nɔ. Nihi ha nɛ wa laa blɔ nɛ wa pee wa he akɔnɔ níhi kɛ he lo se dili. Wa je mi bami hyi tɔ kɛ hetsɛ kɛ nyɛmi. Wa nyɛɛ nihi, nɛ nihi hu nyɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="TIT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Se benɛ Mawu nɛ ji wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ e mi mi jɔmi kɛ e suɔmi ɔ je kpo ɔ, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />e he wa yi wami, pi ngɛ himi nɛ wa hi ɔ he je, se mohu ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi kɛ e mɔbɔ nami nya nɛ e fɔ wa he yayami ɔmɛ ngɛ, nɛ e ha wa na bua jɔmi he kɛ je Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ dɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />E ha nɛ wa hyi tɔ kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu Kristo, wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ tsu ha wɔ ɔ he, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />konɛ e wo wa hɛ mi nyami ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi babauu ɔ he. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wa maa pee neneene wami ɔ nɛ e ha wɔ ɔ e mi ni yeli, nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe kɛ hɛ nɔ kami nɛ wa nine nɛ su nɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Anɔkuale munyuhi ji níhi nɛ i de mo nɛ ɔ nɛ. Moo hyɛ nɛ a pee bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli a tsu ni tsumi kpakpa be fɛɛ be, ejakaa e hi nɛ e woɔ yiblii hulɔ.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />O kɛ o hɛ nɛ ko wo kuasia nya samihi kɛ weku sisi tsɔɔmi kɛ pɛ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a he kunɔ nɔmi ɔ mi, ejakaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he be se nami, awi mohu nɛ a yeɔ nɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɔ́ mi gbae ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, moo bɔ lɛ kɔkɔ si kake kɛ si enyɔ, nɛ ke e tsakee we ɔ, moo ngmɛɛ e he. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Ejakaa nɔmlɔ kaa kikɛ ɔ, e ngɛ juɛmi yaya nɛ e le kaa yayami e ngɛ pee.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />I ngɛ hlae nɛ ma tsɔ Artema loo Tihiko kɛ ba o ngɔ. Ke a ti nɔ ko ba su o ngɔ nɔuu ɔ, moo bɔ mɔde nɛ o kɛ mi ba kpe ngɛ Nikopoli, ejakaa i to kaa ma ya ye fiɛ be ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Bɔɔ mɔde nɛ o wo Zena, mlaa tsɔɔlɔ ɔ, kɛ Apolo blɔ saminya. Moo hyɛ nɛ o ha mɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ he maa hia mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />E sa kaa wa ni ɔmɛ nɛ kase bɔ nɛ sa nɛ a ye kɛ bua ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ fimi mi ɔ, konɛ a wo yiblii kpakpa.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kɛ mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ ke a biɔ mo. Wa biɔ huɛmɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa. Mawu dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ kulaa nɛ hi si.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>